      "role": "user",
      "content": "I want to add some notes to a quotation explaining some special requirements. How do I do it?"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To add notes to a quotation, use the Descriptive Texts (B-Mask) for that offer:\n1. Open the quotation in editing mode.\n2. Invoke the Descriptive Texts function for the current document (B-Mask).\n3. Choose the Change action to open the texts for editing.\n4. In the Text Lines area, add your note and assign the appropriate department and line type.\n5. Save and exit the B-Mask to return to the quotation.",
